{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"ferrety-crippling-dairycow","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\nThe current-main grounding/analyzer timing cohort passes, but `tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_output_schema_coverage.py::test_canonical_tool_result_validates[grounding_info]` emits `pydantic_settings.sources.utils.IncompleteFieldDefinitionWarning`: field `lifespan` has an incomplete definition containing an unresolved forward reference and settings sources may fail to resolve its value. No open bug matching the warning text or lifespan/settings mechanism was found.\n\n## Reproduction\nRun the focused MCP schema node with the repository virtualenv:\n`pytest -q tests/interfaces/facades/test_mcp_output_schema_coverage.py::test_canonical_tool_result_validates[grounding_info]`\nThe test passes with one warning from `pydantic_settings/sources/utils.py:47`.\n\n## Plan\n- Use rebar-debug to trace which model/settings class owns the `lifespan` field and prove why its forward reference remains unresolved.\n- Determine whether the warning is caused by rebar model initialization, MCP/Starlette integration, or an upstream compatibility issue.\n- Add a withheld warning-as-error oracle at the narrowest public construction boundary.\n- Remediate only after the root cause is proven, preserving MCP startup and `grounding_info` schema behavior.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The exact owning model and unresolved annotation are identified with runtime evidence.\n- [ ] The focused MCP `grounding_info` schema test passes with this warning promoted to an error.\n- [ ] MCP server construction and lifecycle behavior remain unchanged unless the operator approves a behavioral change.\n- [ ] The full MCP facade schema-coverage module passes without the warning.\n\n## Verification\n- Run the focused node with `-W error::pydantic_settings.sources.utils.IncompleteFieldDefinitionWarning`.\n- Run the MCP facade schema-coverage module, lint, and typecheck.","id":"bdd8-8cfb-a752-4edc","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":["warning","mcp","pydantic"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"MCP grounding_info schema test emits unresolved lifespan forward-reference warning"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1786911032614478001,"uuid":"9bae5458-992f-4ba4-b9d5-ecb122fd023d"}